        "timestamp": "2020-05-14T11:34:26"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 472,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 385,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 62544,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 110,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> an ovarian tumour with a variable mixture of blastemal and epithelial and mesenchymal elements, without a renal mass.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-14T11:34:26"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 470,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 383,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 62545,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 110,
        "headingId": 383,
        "headingText": "<p>The US National Wilms Tumor Study considers all extrarenal Wilms tumours to be at least stage&nbsp;II; therefore, all cases require chemotherapy {31815892}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-08-06T16:24:34"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 471,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 384,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 62546,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 110,
        "headingId": 384,
        "headingText": "<p>Experience is limited; however, no documented deaths of disease have been reported after a follow-up ranging from 3 to 108&nbsp;months, even in those patients who had advanced-stage disease or recurrence shortly after surgery {31815892; 30701637}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-08-06T16:24:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]